Third-party components

This MIT license covers the source code of Tafseer Clipper. It does NOT cover
the third-party software the application bundles or downloads, which keeps its
own license:

- FFmpeg (bundled as ffmpeg.exe / ffprobe.exe) is distributed under the
  **GPL v3**. Distributing an installer that contains it therefore carries the
  GPL's obligations (source availability, and its terms for the combined
  distribution) regardless of this file.
- The optional GPU acceleration pack (CUDA runtime / cuDNN) is proprietary
  NVIDIA software, downloaded at runtime and not bundled.
- Whisper model weights are downloaded at runtime under their own license.

See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the full inventory.
